# Deployed to the Space repository root as `.dockerignore` by
# .github/workflows/sync-hf-space.yml. Written as an allowlist rather than a
# list of things to skip, because the Space repo is also a place people drop
# files by hand through the HF web UI — an audio file uploaded there to try
# something out must not end up baked into the next image.
#
# (A local `docker build -f deploy/huggingface/Dockerfile .` from a full
# checkout uses the repository's own root .dockerignore instead of this one;
# that file already keeps the weights, audio and node_modules out.)
*
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md
!LICENSE
!muscriptor
!deploy

# Never ship a stale local build of the web UI or of anything else: the chord
# service serves no static files at all.
muscriptor/web_dist
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
